{"id":1930,"date":"2023-04-06T13:20:24","date_gmt":"2023-04-06T03:50:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=1930"},"modified":"2023-04-28T18:17:46","modified_gmt":"2023-04-28T08:47:46","slug":"what-are-google-shopping-feeds","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-are-google-shopping-feeds\/","title":{"rendered":"Google Shopping Feed Explained: Everything You need to Know"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1930\" class=\"elementor elementor-1930\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c893f0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3c893f0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cef741d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cef741d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you&#8217;re an online retailer or advertising agency, you&#8217;ve likely encountered the term &#8220;Google Shopping feed&#8221; before. So, what exactly is a Google Shopping feed, and why is it important for your business? In this blog post, we&#8217;ll first dive into the basics of Google Shopping feeds and then explore how they can benefit your advertising efforts.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6cd0a5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d6cd0a5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41ba56d elementor-toc--minimized-on-tablet elementor-widget elementor-widget-table-of-contents\" data-id=\"41ba56d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;headings_by_tags&quot;:[&quot;h2&quot;,&quot;h3&quot;],&quot;exclude_headings_by_selector&quot;:[],&quot;collapse_subitems&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;marker_view&quot;:&quot;numbers&quot;,&quot;no_headings_message&quot;:&quot;No headings were found on this page.&quot;,&quot;minimize_box&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;minimized_on&quot;:&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;hierarchical_view&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;min_height&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_laptop&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"table-of-contents.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-toc__header-title\">\n\t\t\t\tJump to section \t\t\t<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__toggle-button elementor-toc__toggle-button--expand\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-toc__41ba56d\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open table of contents\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-chevron-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__toggle-button elementor-toc__toggle-button--collapse\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-toc__41ba56d\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Close table of contents\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-chevron-up\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-toc__41ba56d\" class=\"elementor-toc__body elementor-toc__list-items--collapsible\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__spinner-container\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"elementor-toc__spinner eicon-animation-spin e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M500 975V858C696 858 858 696 858 500S696 142 500 142 142 304 142 500H25C25 237 238 25 500 25S975 237 975 500 763 975 500 975Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-505179b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"505179b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99838bc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"99838bc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c283b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8c283b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Why is a Google Shopping feed important?<\/h2><p>When you use a Google Shopping feed you can reach a wider audience of potential customers actively searching for your products on Google. This helps you reach customers who may not know about your business yet.<\/p><p>A Google Shopping feed drives more targeted traffic to your website than traditional search ads. Your ads are triggered by the product data in your feed, resulting in higher click-through rates and conversions from people who are more likely to be interested in your products.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f78eef e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9f78eef\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4eb51fc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4eb51fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6426690 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6426690\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/app.feedops.com\/sign_up\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Google-Shopping-Feed-FeedOps-AI-ra6c0nz4y4uhbev7ugwuhg0rs21i3qng8oua0e85l0.png\" title=\"Google Shopping Feed &#8211; FeedOps AI\" alt=\"Google Shopping Feed + FeedOps AI + Product Feed Management\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8f7f47 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e8f7f47\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d4f032 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0d4f032\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Signals for machine learning come from your feed.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-415a6f7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"415a6f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f71bf6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3f71bf6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Google uses product data as signals for machine learning in Google Shopping. The accuracy and detail of your Google Shopping feed are crucial for optimal performance. Google uses signals to match your products to relevant search queries and show your <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/blogs\/product-listing-ads\/\">product listing ads<\/a> to the right audience. Relevant product descriptions and keywords increase the chances of showing your products to interested customers.<\/p><h3><span style=\"background-color: transparent; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Ensure Product Data Accuracy and Detail<\/span><\/h3><p>Google determines your products&#8217; attributes and characteristics, such as brand, category, and size, by using your product data. To ensure optimal performance, make sure your product data is accurate and up-to-date. T<\/p><ol><li><b style=\"background-color: transparent; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Match Products to Relevant Queries:\u00a0<\/b>Google relies on the product data you provide to match your products to relevant search queries. Therefore, to ensure your products align with the right searches, it&#8217;s essential to accurately describe them in your product data. For instance, when selling shoes, including attributes like shoe type, brand, color, and size can be particularly helpful.<\/li><li><b>Show Ads to the Right Audience:\u00a0<\/b>Google utilizes product data to display your ads to the appropriate audience. Thus, it&#8217;s crucial to accurately describe your intended audience within your product data. For example, when selling women&#8217;s shoes, including attributes like gender and age group in your product data helps ensure ads reach the right audience.<\/li><li><b>Use Relevant Descriptions and Keywords:\u00a0<\/b>Google&#8217;s algorithms employ product descriptions and keywords to comprehend the content and context of your products. For instance, when selling running shoes, incorporate keywords like &#8220;running shoes,&#8221; &#8220;athletic shoes,&#8221; and &#8220;sport shoes&#8221; into your product data. Ensure your product descriptions are detailed and accurate, offering information about features, benefits, and product usage.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-038e7b3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"038e7b3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dba1a20 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"dba1a20\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40d3f19 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"40d3f19\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Improving ROI\u00a0<\/h2><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>It&#8217;s essential to realize that, while creating a Google Shopping feed, your product data is utilized in your ads. The product title transforms into the ad title and appears just above the price. Employing <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/blogs\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\">shopping feed management <\/a>can optimize your ads effectively.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a87a92 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6a87a92\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f758c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5f758c3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What information should you include in your feed?<\/h2><p>When creating a Google Shopping feed, it&#8217;s important to include as much relevant information about your products as possible. Here are some of the key pieces of information that you should include:<\/p><ol><li><b>Product title<\/b>: Your product title should be clear and descriptive, and should accurately reflect what the product is.<\/li><li><b>Product description:<\/b> Your product description should be detailed and provide as much information about the product as possible. This can include things like product dimensions, materials, and other relevant details.<\/li><li><b>Product images: <\/b>You should include high-quality images of your products that show them from multiple angles and in different contexts.<\/li><li><b>Product price: <\/b>Your product price should be accurate and up-to-date. You should also make sure to include any relevant discounts or promotions that are currently available.<\/li><li><b>Product availability: <\/b>You should indicate whether the product is currently in stock or not, as this can impact whether or not customers choose to make a purchase.<\/li><li><b>Product identifiers:<\/b> You should include any relevant product identifiers, such as a GTIN, UPC or ISBN number.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eb78dfc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"eb78dfc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8116c60 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8116c60\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>How do you create a Google Shopping feed?<\/h2><p>Creating a Google Shopping feed can be a bit complicated, but there are a few different ways to do it. Here are some of the most common methods:<\/p><ol><li><b>Use a shopping cart platform:<\/b> Many e-commerce platforms, such as Shopify and WooCommerce, have built-in integrations with Google Shopping that allow you to easily create and manage your feed.\u00a0 You can also find\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/apps.shopify.com\/feedops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FeedOps in the Shopify<\/a>\u00a0app store and FeedOps In the BigCommerce App stores. Download the app and get started for free.<\/li><li><b>Use a <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/blog\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\">feed management tool<\/a>: <\/b>There are a variety of third-party tools that you will find on Google. Ours is called <a href=\"http:\/\/home\" data-wplink-url-error=\"true\">FeedOps<\/a>. You can <a href=\"https:\/\/app.feedops.com\/sign_up\">sign up for free<\/a> and begin the process of product feed management. It comes with a playbook to help you to identify the problem areas.<\/li><li><b>Create your feed manually: <\/b>If you have a small number of products, you can create your feed manually using a spreadsheet or text editor. You can then upload it into\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/intl\/en\/retail\/solutions\/merchant-center\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Merchant Center<\/a><\/li><\/ol><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6621ae8d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6621ae8d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e9451c5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4e9451c5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e15d82f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2e15d82f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2033\" alt=\"explain fed optimization to a 5 year old\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1.png 500w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2909c131 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2909c131\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b931bc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b931bc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Explain a Shopping Feeds to a 12 year old!<\/h2><p>The article is talking about a service called &#8220;Google Shopping,&#8221; which is a way for people to search for and buy products online. In order for a product to appear on Google Shopping, the seller needs to provide some information about the product, such as the name, description, and price. This information is called a &#8220;feed.&#8221;<\/p><p>This article is about how to create a good feed for Google Shopping. It gives some tips and advice for sellers to make sure their feed is accurate and complete, so that their products show up in search results and people can find and buy them.<\/p><p>So, in summary: Google Shopping is a way to buy things online, and the article is about how to make sure your products show up in Google Shopping by creating a good feed with accurate and complete information.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>If you&#8217;re an online retailer or advertising agency, you&#8217;ve likely encountered the term &#8220;Google Shopping feed&#8221; before. So, what exactly is a Google Shopping feed, and why is it important for your business? In this blog post, we&#8217;ll first dive into the basics of Google Shopping feeds and then explore how they can benefit your [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":1989,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1930","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Google Shopping Feed Explained: Everything You need to Know<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"You&#039;ve likely heard the term &quot;Google Shopping feed&quot; before. But what is a Google Shopping feed, and why is it important for your business?\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-are-google-shopping-feeds\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Google Shopping Feed Explained: Everything You need to Know\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"You&#039;ve likely heard the term &quot;Google Shopping feed&quot; before. But what is a Google Shopping feed, and why is it important for your business?\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-are-google-shopping-feeds\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-04-06T03:50:24+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-28T08:47:46+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/What-is-a-Google-Shopping-Feed-1.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2240\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1260\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"6 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-are-google-shopping-feeds\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-are-google-shopping-feeds\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"